{"availability":"available","full":"mongodb-developer/mongodb-chatgpt-sdk-demo","name":"mongodb-chatgpt-sdk-demo","description":"mongodb-chatgpt-sdk-demo is a Next.js 15 starter that shows how to pair MongoDB Atlas, Vercel, and the ChatGPT Apps SDK to build a collaborative to-do assistant. The same Atlas-backed APIs drive both the traditional web UI and the Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools that make the experience available directly inside ChatGPT.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":3,"created":"2025-11-09T14:21:44Z","updated":"2025-12-17T06:18:20Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["atlas","mcp","mongodb","nextjs","nodejs","openai","react","typescript"],"demo":"https://www.mongodb.com/atlas","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:08:23.420Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:08:23.420Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:08:23.420Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:08:23.420Z","stars":0,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["mongodb-chatgpt-sdk-demo is a Next.js 15 starter that shows how to pair MongoDB Atlas, Vercel, and the ChatGPT Apps SDK to build a collaborative to-do assistant. The same Atlas-backed APIs drive both the traditional web UI and the Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools that make the experience available directly inside ChatGPT."],"features":["Shared task lists. todolists and todoitems collections live in Atlas, complete with optimistic UI updates, sharing links, and live refresh via SWR.","Zero-friction local dev. lib/mongodb.ts drops into an in-memory store when MONGODBURI is unset, so you can demo without a network connection and switch to Atlas by setting one env variable.","ChatGPT-native tooling. /api/mcp/[transport]/route.ts registers widget HTML plus tools for creating, listing, updating, and deleting todos so ChatGPT can talk to the exact same backend.","One deployment path. Vercel hosts the app, serves